    "d61d2d09-e58d-49dd-9641-a6b2e54cd0e1": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--15349666119867__d61d2d09-e58d-49dd-9641-a6b2e54cd0e1-1670357947ebcf7e8f-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "terms and conditions"
          }
        },
        "template--15349666119867__d61d2d09-e58d-49dd-9641-a6b2e54cd0e1-1670357947ebcf7e8f-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>T SQUARED PUTTERS Demo Program:</strong><br/>1. The T SQUARED PUTTERS Demo Program allows you to try one T SQUARED PUTTER at a time for up to 14 days per household, and is limited to stock on hand.</p><p>2. Once you’ve selected your demo putter, you will be charged a service fee of $50 upon checkout. <em>Note: We do not guarantee that you will receive a brand new club for demo through this program.</em></p><p>3. By ordering a demo putter, you are giving us the right to charge your credit card at a later date if it is not returned.</p><p>4. If you fail to return your demo putter following the 14-day trial period, <em><strong>you will be charged full retail price </strong></em>for that particular putter.</p><p>5. If you choose to keep your Demo Putter, <em><strong>you will be charged the current advertised price </strong></em>for that model.</p><p>6. If you like the club you tested but want to purchase a brand new one, return the demo putter within the 14-day trial period. And then order your new T SQUARED PUTTER.</p><p>7. During checkout, you must provide your email address and phone number in order to receive communications and instructions from us, regarding our Demo Program.</p><p>8. Once we’ve processed your order, we will ship the club(s) to you. <em>Note: Your 14-day trial period begins once you </em><em><strong>receive </strong></em><em>the club and not when your club was processed or shipped. This will be determined by the delivery scan from our shipper.</em></p><p>9. Once your club has shipped, we will send you an email alerting you that your demo putter is on the way.</p><p>10. All T SQUARED Demo Putters are built to standard specifications: 34\" length, 4 degree loft and 70 degree lie specifications, and come with a mid-size T Squared grip.</p><p>11. Demo Putters are only available when in stock, and this program is limited to customers within the continental U.S., Alaska and Hawaii.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
